    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Highway Hopper!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.poster.avif?t=1750690148\" width=384 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.webm?t=1750690148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.mp4?t=1750690148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway Hopper</strong> is a fast-paced 2D pixel art platformer where you jump over guardrails along an endless highway. Dodge cars, signs, airplanes, and buildings, collect points, and beat your high score! With simple controls, stylish retro design, and an engaging flow, every jump is a little thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you last?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Highway Hopper!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.poster.avif?t=1750690148\" width=384 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.webm?t=1750690148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732440/extras/53cb202f528d22d75036381e10d55963.mp4?t=1750690148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highway Hopper</strong> is a fast-paced 2D pixel art platformer where you jump over guardrails along an endless highway. Dodge cars, signs, airplanes, and buildings, collect points, and beat your high score! With simple controls, stylish retro design, and an engaging flow, every jump is a little thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long can you last?</strong></p>",
